{"t": 1795385465.16, "adal_tool": "create_file", "deed": "file.edit", "class": "WRITE", "args": {"new_string": "# Chakravyuha v7\n\nDate: 2026-11-23 \u00b7 POC: AdaL\nTL;DR: Two 104-second, 1920\u00d71080, 30 fps cuts for the Aegis demonstration.\n\nBoth cuts use the 18 beats specified in the brief, sourced from `video/assets7`. The V1 track has full-screen artwork, a centered 2% push on the stills, and 12-frame dissolves. ", "path": "C:/Users/jaswa/AdaL/Videos/chakravyuha-v7-2/project.md"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795385483.22, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts", "output_filename": "cue-06", "text": "Aegis checks every action an agent takes, before it runs. It judges what the agent does, not what it says.", "values": "['Sulafat', 'Warm grounded professional English. Clear conversational read in 4.7 seconds; run the two sentences together with only the briefest natural breath, no pauses at commas, no dramatic emphasis. Aegis is EE-jiss.']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795385492.28, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts", "output_filename": "cue-11", "text": "In the Mahabharata, the Chakravyuha was a spiral formation. Easy to walk into. Built so no one gets out.", "values": "['Sulafat', 'Warm grounded professional English. Say all the words in under 6.6 seconds. Flow straight through the punctuation with brief pauses only. Natural and clear, no dramatic pauses. Respect Sanskrit names.']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795385499.54, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts", "output_filename": "cue-18", "text": "We turned it around. Aegis builds those rings around every AI agent, so a hijacked agent cannot get out.", "values": "['Sulafat', 'Warm grounded professional English. Read comfortably in 5.7 seconds by keeping punctuation pauses very short, no dramatic emphasis. Aegis is EE-jiss.']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795385506.58, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts", "output_filename": "cue-24", "text": "To prove it, two agents fight. Red plays a hijacked finance agent. Blue defends. Aegis referees every move.", "values": "['Sulafat', 'Warm grounded professional English. Speak the four sentences in a single natural flow in 5.7 seconds or less; no theatrical pauses. Aegis is EE-jiss.']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795385513.62, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts", "output_filename": "cue-47", "text": "Blue adds a rule, and Ada Ell, an AI coding agent, patches the code. Aegis checks Ada Ell too.", "values": "['Sulafat', 'Warm grounded professional English. Short punctuation pauses, under 5.8 seconds. Ada Ell is the product name AdaL; speak Ell as the distinct English letter L. Aegis is EE-jiss.']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
